{"applicability_conditions":"适用于奥氏体体积分数超过80 vol%的含Nb低密度钢；文中用于0.02Nb和0.04Nb钢的奥氏体强化机制定量分析。","identity":{"block_id":"b0085","equation_id":"equation_002","equation_number":"2","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma_ {a} = \\left(\\sigma_ {0} + \\sigma_ {s} + \\sigma_ {g} + \\sigma_ {p} + \\sigma_ {d}\\right) * V _ {a}\\tag{2}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1002_srin.202400475"},"latex":"\\sigma_{a} = \\left(\\sigma_{0} + \\sigma_{s} + \\sigma_{g} + \\sigma_{p} + \\sigma_{d}\\right) * V_{a}","purpose":"定量评估奥氏体对含Nb低密度钢屈服强度的贡献，将奥氏体中的各强化机制贡献之和乘以奥氏体体积分数。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"奥氏体对钢屈服强度的贡献","symbol":"\\sigma_{a}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"晶格摩擦应力 (lattice friction stress)","symbol":"\\sigma_{0}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"固溶强化贡献 (solid solution strengthening)","symbol":"\\sigma_{s}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"晶界强化贡献 (grain boundary strengthening)","symbol":"\\sigma_{g}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"析出强化贡献 (precipitation strengthening)","symbol":"\\sigma_{p}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错强化贡献 (dislocation strengthening)","symbol":"\\sigma_{d}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"奥氏体体积分数","symbol":"V_{a}","unit":"vol%","value":null}],"unmapped":["奥氏体占体积分数超过80 vol%，在决定低密度钢力学性能中起主导作用。","Nb含量增加和时效处理对奥氏体中固溶强化的影响有限，因为Nb添加量相对较小。"]}